1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth:	Nov 13 1785 - Liden, Västerbotten, Sweden
2 CONT * Death:	Dec 18 1855 - Indal, Västernorrland, Sweden
2 CONT * Parents:	Johan Johansson, Sara Johansson (born Palsdotter)
2 CONT * Wife:	Anna Brita Johansson (born Olofsdotter)
2 CONT * Children:	Johan Olof Pålsson, Ingrid Brita Gerdsdorff (born Pålsdotter), Sara Kajsa Forss (born Pålsdotter), Engla Lisa Pålsdotter, Per Anders Pålsson, Pål Pålsson Bäckvall, Anna Lisa Pålsdotter, and name of one more son
2 CONT * Siblings:	Olof Linde, Johan Jonsson, Eric Johanson, Johan Johanson, Pehr Johanson, Magnus Johanson, Anders Johansson
2 CONT
2 CONT
