2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Familj med Elisabet Flodalin (1648 - )
2 CONT
2 CONT Vigsel:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1671 3)
2 CONT
