1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Uggla_nr_100#TAB_65
2 CONT
2 CONT Clas was cornet 28 Aug 1783 in Nylands och Tavastehus Läns Dragoon Regiment. He served 1788-1790 in the Finnish war. He was decorated with Gold medal for brevery 9 Jul 1790. He served as second lieutenant in Tavastehus Regiment’s 
2 CONC Jägarbataljon (elite battalion) 12 May 1796. He served also in the Finnish war 1808-1809. He retired with captain rank 8 May 1810. He was owner of Kellosalmi manor in Padasjoki since 1811. He lived after that in Padasjoki. He was 
2 CONC dying in apoplectic stroke in Orimattila during a journey 24 Oct 1840.
2 CONT
