1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She married lieutenant Per Fredrik Björkman in 1859 and got as wedding gift 1/10th of the Gisslén property --and with a new large house, barn and brew-house built on the given property.   They had no childrwen but 
2 CONC lived a rather lawish life that led to bankruptcy and divorse in 1869.   On february 6, 1873 she married the handyman and shoemaker Gustav Svensson born august 15, 1828.   In connection with this wedding she received another small
2 CONC er piece of property also from the Gisslén farm --just east of the Krångede border --and south, along the main road.   Also a new house was built on this property.   Gustav made a very nice stairway in this house.
